# Line endings that must not change on a checkout, on any OS. These are the
# files that run on Linux, macOS and in WSL (a CRLF breaks a shell script) and
# install.ps1, which is served raw from GitHub with LF endings. Existing files
# already have these endings, so nothing is renormalized.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.tmpl text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
/benchbar text eol=lf
/install.sh text eol=lf
/templates/** text eol=lf
